-Xms1g
-Xmx4g
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=1024m
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=1g
-Xss4M
# jc-kzg-4844 (build.sbt, evm) calls System.load, a JEP 472 restricted method
# on JDK 25+. Ungranted, the call still succeeds but warns on every load.
# This file, not Test/javaOptions, is where the grant belongs: Test/fork is
# false in every module, so tests run in this JVM rather than a forked one --
# see build.sbt's jc-kzg-4844 entry for how that was checked.
--enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED